WEBVTT

00:03.020 --> 00:05.070
What... did you say?

00:06.270 --> 00:08.080
I was saying,

00:08.080 --> 00:11.080
let's go kill the Emperor right now.

00:11.390 --> 00:14.200
Aren't you on the Emperor's side?

00:14.200 --> 00:15.670
What is this all about?

00:17.760 --> 00:20.780
You're prepared to fight 
the Empire as well, right?

00:21.740 --> 00:22.690
Then...

00:24.050 --> 00:26.770
Loki... did you betray us?

00:28.180 --> 00:31.120
Rebels who go against the 
Emperor and the assembly...

00:31.120 --> 00:32.350
will be eradicated!

00:34.060 --> 00:34.970
Ema—

00:40.870 --> 00:43.530
You really don't learn, huh?

00:44.020 --> 00:47.310
You're already caught inside my ability.

00:51.450 --> 00:53.630
Just sit tight there for a while.

00:55.000 --> 00:56.590
There's no wound?

00:56.590 --> 00:58.790
So the stabbing was an illusion?

00:59.970 --> 01:03.260
Hey, why am I bound as well?

01:03.600 --> 01:07.050
Well, shall we go, then?

01:09.580 --> 01:11.180
To the imperial palace?

01:14.000 --> 01:19.010
Episode 5
We know we are not worthy
O great Lord Mitama
You created all things—

01:14.420 --> 01:15.790
We know we are not worthy

01:15.790 --> 01:16.870
O great Lord Mitama

01:16.870 --> 01:19.010
You created all things—

01:37.290 --> 01:39.650
This is the center of the imperial capital.

01:40.560 --> 01:41.760
The imperial palace.

01:56.000 --> 02:02.660
And this is the Emperor's audience room.

02:10.910 --> 02:12.860
Let's go, then.

02:29.170 --> 02:31.000
I have no excuse!

02:31.000 --> 02:32.680
I failed in eradicating the 
isolation camp village,

02:32.680 --> 02:35.580
and now I've allowed these filthy 
rebels to stand before you!

02:36.560 --> 02:41.130
Good work, Loki, Atar.

02:41.890 --> 02:44.470
<i>So that's the Emperor...</i>

02:44.660 --> 02:45.570
Your Highness!

02:45.570 --> 02:47.280
Your words are too kind,

02:47.280 --> 02:48.150
however...!

02:48.150 --> 02:49.410
It doesn't matter.

02:49.410 --> 02:51.440
This was foretold as well.

02:51.440 --> 02:54.230
And Urabe Yukito.

02:54.230 --> 03:00.820
We also know that you're trying to revive 
silly notions like "god" and "religion".

03:01.740 --> 03:08.250
Seeing you writhe in your silly fantasy 
and racking your brain is truly humorous.

03:08.250 --> 03:09.330
<i>What is going on?!</i>

03:09.710 --> 03:15.880
We have seen many countries fight 
and ultimately destroyed for "god".

03:10.040 --> 03:12.480
<i>The Emperor knows about "god"?</i>

03:12.480 --> 03:15.880
<i>Why? I thought nobody in this world knew...</i>

03:16.470 --> 03:21.020
We thought long and hard about 
how to prevent this destruction.

03:21.020 --> 03:25.540
The answer is to properly 
control the people

03:25.540 --> 03:29.720
and thus eliminate needless 
thoughts from their lives.

03:30.220 --> 03:37.130
If you are truly attempting to bring back 
the silly notions of god and religion...

03:32.810 --> 03:37.130
<i>Could the Emperor also be someone 
who came here from another world?</i>

03:38.500 --> 03:39.410
Mitama?!

03:39.410 --> 03:40.320
Huh?

03:40.500 --> 03:44.950
Oh, I was just wondering if this was the 
thing that's making everybody weird.

03:44.950 --> 03:46.150
Weird?

03:46.150 --> 03:47.460
I mean, this whole time,

03:47.460 --> 03:50.450
both you and that girl have been...

03:54.000 --> 03:56.790
talking to a dead person.

04:11.300 --> 04:13.900
I figured you might see 
through it, Mitama-chan.

04:15.040 --> 04:21.110
What you've been seeing until now was a fake 
image that this room's facilities created.

04:31.510 --> 04:34.430
There is no Emperor in 
this country anymore.

04:34.430 --> 04:35.120
What?

04:35.300 --> 04:37.660
There is no Emperor in this country.

04:38.260 --> 04:42.250
The being that was called 
the Emperor died ages ago.

04:42.820 --> 04:44.030
After that,

04:44.030 --> 04:48.570
the Empire was controlled by this 
room that he had put together.

04:49.010 --> 04:53.310
The things in this room are 
apparently called "machines".

04:54.030 --> 04:57.180
I've been watching over 
this room for many years,

04:57.180 --> 04:58.770
but I do not understand their workings.

05:00.780 --> 05:01.520
Still,

05:01.890 --> 05:05.350
these "machines" have been analyzing and 
controlling all manner of things,

05:05.350 --> 05:08.110
such as the Empire's economy, food stuffs,

05:08.110 --> 05:11.000
population growth and decline, 
natural phenomena.

05:11.000 --> 05:13.490
All to maintain the Empire 
in an unchanging state.

05:14.310 --> 05:17.790
All this is actually what 
the people call "the assembly".

05:20.860 --> 05:26.100
This country has been kept up like 
this for an unfathomably long time.

05:27.040 --> 05:29.050
But I don't know how many 
centuries it's been.

05:29.360 --> 05:31.800
Wh-What are you saying?

05:32.580 --> 05:33.930
<i>I see.</i>

05:34.380 --> 05:37.810
<i>This means that this world has 
been controlled by science.</i>

05:38.040 --> 05:40.730
<i>The isolation of those who don't adhere,</i>

05:40.730 --> 05:42.770
<i>the absolute insistence on control,</i>

05:42.770 --> 05:44.020
<i>the eradication of sexual things,</i>

05:44.020 --> 05:45.320
<i>the end of life system,</i>

05:45.320 --> 05:46.940
<i>all of those are to control the population.</i>

05:46.940 --> 05:49.740
<i>However, no matter how you look at it,</i>

05:49.740 --> 05:53.040
<i>these machines are more advanced 
than anything in my old world.</i>

05:53.040 --> 05:54.530
<i>What exactly is this world,</i>

05:54.530 --> 05:57.620
<i>if stuff like this and the 
archons' weapons exist?</i>

05:57.620 --> 05:59.330
Centuries?

05:59.330 --> 06:00.830
You really don't get it.

06:00.830 --> 06:02.720
Several thousands of years ago,

06:02.720 --> 06:06.840
this country—no, this world 
had already been destroyed.

06:07.020 --> 06:07.610
What?

06:08.010 --> 06:10.110
Its civilization was once annihilated,

06:10.110 --> 06:12.600
and then a few smart people 
among the survivors

06:12.600 --> 06:17.680
banded together and built a land that 
could never meet that fate again.

06:17.900 --> 06:22.660
And then those guys went right ahead 
and just deleted belief in us gods!

06:22.660 --> 06:23.900
So rude!

06:24.130 --> 06:25.730
Isn't it, Yukito?

06:26.800 --> 06:28.160
W-Wait.

06:28.160 --> 06:30.340
What do you mean...

06:30.340 --> 06:32.070
that their civilization was annihilated?

06:34.320 --> 06:35.160
Huh?

06:35.910 --> 06:38.940
I'm asking you what this world is!

06:38.940 --> 06:40.410
What do you know?!

06:40.410 --> 06:42.680
H-Hey, calm down.

06:42.680 --> 06:44.470
What is this world, you ask?

06:44.470 --> 06:47.930
It's Ashihara no Nakatsukuni, of course.

06:47.930 --> 06:50.400
In your words, it's Earth.

06:51.350 --> 06:52.010
Huh?

06:52.200 --> 06:56.230
I looked super far into the 
future from where you were,

06:56.230 --> 06:58.980
then brought you to this time.

06:59.620 --> 07:00.570
Future?

07:00.570 --> 07:01.480
Yes.

07:01.890 --> 07:03.310
Not another world?

07:03.310 --> 07:04.230
Correct.

07:04.560 --> 07:06.060
You brought me here?

07:06.060 --> 07:07.020
Yup.

07:07.490 --> 07:09.000
Why?

07:09.320 --> 07:13.120
Why? You wished for it.

07:13.120 --> 07:14.400
<i>God, my ass.</i>

07:14.400 --> 07:16.240
<i>Omniscient, omnipotent, my ass.</i>

07:16.240 --> 07:17.560
<i>If you truly exist,</i>

07:17.560 --> 07:21.290
<i>how about letting me be reborn in 
a world without gods or religion?</i>

07:21.290 --> 07:23.210
It wasn't so easy, you know?

07:23.210 --> 07:27.740
Finding a time in mankind's history 
with that kind of situation.

07:29.860 --> 07:32.350
I did a good job, didn't I?!

07:34.130 --> 07:37.390
I knew it, gods are shit.

07:37.390 --> 07:38.660
What is this...

07:38.660 --> 07:40.330
What is this?!

07:40.330 --> 07:43.600
Even after I came to a world 
with no gods or religion,

07:43.600 --> 07:46.350
I'm still just a plaything in their hands!

07:47.120 --> 07:48.810
By the way, Mitama-chan.

07:50.880 --> 07:54.080
How about we break the 
"machines" in this room?

07:54.080 --> 07:56.830
I think that would bring about 
the destruction of the Empire.

07:56.990 --> 07:57.620
Loki?!

07:57.620 --> 07:58.700
What are you—

07:58.700 --> 08:00.620
I'm sick and tired of it.

08:01.200 --> 08:05.310
Us archons were born so that 
we would live for the Empire!

08:05.310 --> 08:06.500
That's what we were made for!

08:06.680 --> 08:12.050
Why does the control need to go on 
if those who had control are dead?

08:12.750 --> 08:15.970
I want for this charade to end already.

08:16.740 --> 08:18.480
Then Yukito and the others

08:18.480 --> 08:22.890
won't have to fear the end of life system 
or attacks from the Imperial army.

08:24.530 --> 08:27.320
So please, Mitama-chan.

08:27.320 --> 08:32.190
Hah, you don't have to ask me twice 
to delete anyone who hurts Yukito.

08:33.110 --> 08:34.430
Wait.

08:34.430 --> 08:35.440
What is it, Yuki—

08:54.660 --> 08:56.470
That came out of nowhere.

08:56.960 --> 09:00.310
I am just giving you useful 
information to help yo—

09:00.310 --> 09:02.850
I knew it, you can't use your powers here.

09:02.850 --> 09:03.920
In this room—

09:03.920 --> 09:05.600
no, around the imperial palace,

09:05.600 --> 09:08.370
the special archon powers 
don't work, right?

09:08.370 --> 09:11.560
It seems the illusion before 
wasn't yours either.

09:12.890 --> 09:15.090
Besides, if you could,

09:15.090 --> 09:17.900
then you wouldn't need to 
bring us all here anyway.

09:18.360 --> 09:20.080
What is your goal?

09:20.080 --> 09:22.030
Why are you trying to 
destroy this country?!

09:22.030 --> 09:23.860
I already told you.

09:23.860 --> 09:26.660
I am sick of how the Empire is.

09:27.340 --> 09:28.830
As you say,

09:28.830 --> 09:31.310
I can't destroy the palace myself.

09:31.310 --> 09:33.670
That's why I wanted to get 
Mitama-chan's help and—

09:36.960 --> 09:39.220
Tell me the truth!

09:50.070 --> 09:52.660
Bye, Father!

09:52.660 --> 09:54.430
I'm off.

10:06.620 --> 10:08.120
Good. Begin.

10:17.460 --> 10:20.470
Today's end of life has 
concluded without issue.

10:30.140 --> 10:34.020
A world where everything is 
completely organized without fail.

10:34.340 --> 10:35.860
The way this country is,

10:35.860 --> 10:37.490
the way the people live...

10:37.670 --> 10:40.630
I was so deeply sick of all of that.

10:51.440 --> 10:52.250
<i>Hmph.</i>

10:53.390 --> 10:56.700
<i>Even insects run away when they 
sense their impending death.</i>

10:58.620 --> 11:05.010
<i>So the humans in this empire who accept the end 
of life system so willingly are beneath insects.</i>

11:09.600 --> 11:13.940
Why did the Emperor create such a world?

11:18.380 --> 11:19.570
<i>What's this?</i>

11:20.110 --> 11:24.480
I had accidentally stumbled upon material 
related to ancient civilization.

11:24.480 --> 11:28.280
Humans who live with free will, 
not ruled by machines.

11:28.280 --> 11:31.410
Isn't this how this world should be?

11:32.220 --> 11:35.460
And they believed in 
something called "god".

11:36.000 --> 11:39.840
"Dakini", "Gaia", "Atar", "Loki"...

11:40.550 --> 11:42.280
<i>What is god?</i>

11:42.780 --> 11:46.080
<i>Why were we given these names?</i>

11:48.960 --> 11:51.590
<i>What are we?</i>

12:02.480 --> 12:05.020
Come on, Clen!

12:05.020 --> 12:08.950
The girls respond better when you're there!

12:08.950 --> 12:13.330
I bet the next village over has 
cuter girls than our village.

12:13.330 --> 12:15.560
So come on, let's go together!

12:15.560 --> 12:17.250
Don't pester me, you moron!

12:17.250 --> 12:18.610
Go by yourself.

12:18.610 --> 12:22.000
And let yourself be eaten by 
a strange beast on the way.

12:22.000 --> 12:22.760
What?

12:22.760 --> 12:26.120
Don't be so cold!

12:26.120 --> 12:29.700
Hitting on girls is scary when I'm alone!

12:29.700 --> 12:31.310
For a long time,

12:29.700 --> 12:32.770
Come on, please!

12:31.310 --> 12:36.900
it's been my hobby to sneak into various 
isolation camps between my archon missions.

12:34.540 --> 12:36.900
I want to go together!

12:37.680 --> 12:41.030
Hey, Clen, I want to hit on girls!

12:41.320 --> 12:42.720
The usual!

12:42.720 --> 12:43.920
Got it!

12:43.920 --> 12:45.200
Me, too!

12:46.240 --> 12:49.330
OK, coming right up!

12:50.390 --> 12:51.780
Here you go, Roy-san.

12:56.920 --> 12:59.460
Isolation camp villages are pleasant.

12:59.740 --> 13:03.170
The inhabitants are not 
controlled by anything.

13:00.090 --> 13:01.340
Roy-san?!

13:03.400 --> 13:05.530
They live according to their free will.

13:05.530 --> 13:06.940
Nothing like the imperial capital.

13:11.490 --> 13:15.140
M-My nose has three holes now!

13:15.140 --> 13:18.810
However, their lives will eventually also 
be over through the end of life system.

13:19.530 --> 13:21.060
Without any deviation,

13:21.060 --> 13:23.310
in this complete orderliness,

13:23.310 --> 13:25.490
they're basically like inorganic material.

13:26.760 --> 13:28.740
Just as I was thinking that,

13:29.430 --> 13:32.130
a strange man arrived at 
the isolation camp village.

13:32.830 --> 13:36.680
So you're saying this world 
doesn't have TV or internet?

13:36.680 --> 13:37.710
Seriously?

13:38.000 --> 13:40.000
Wait, you don't even have electricity?

13:40.000 --> 13:41.170
What are you talking about?

13:41.170 --> 13:43.460
He used strange words...

13:43.460 --> 13:45.560
And why are you still naked?

13:45.560 --> 13:46.630
It's done!

13:46.630 --> 13:48.550
Um, was it Yukito-san?

13:48.950 --> 13:51.720
...and didn't know anything 
about this world.

13:52.100 --> 13:54.710
So, what are we doing here?

13:54.710 --> 13:56.230
We're making wine.

13:56.230 --> 13:58.570
By using fermentation, we'll make alcohol.

13:58.570 --> 14:00.270
This is the preparation for that.

14:00.270 --> 14:01.610
Wine?

14:01.610 --> 14:02.830
Seriously?

14:02.830 --> 14:04.570
You can make wine with this?

14:04.750 --> 14:09.410
Yet he had knowledge of things 
commoners shouldn't have.

14:13.760 --> 14:15.200
And then...

14:15.200 --> 14:16.570
Who's next?!

14:16.570 --> 14:18.240
Cheers!

14:18.240 --> 14:22.470
I guess I could thank god for 
bringing me to this world.

14:22.470 --> 14:23.460
God?

14:23.460 --> 14:25.280
No, I take that back!

14:25.280 --> 14:27.500
No way I'm thanking some shitty god.

14:27.500 --> 14:30.620
The moment I do, they might tell 
me to lick their toes or something.

14:30.620 --> 14:33.850
I bet nothing's more annoying than 
a god who's full of themselves.

14:34.180 --> 14:36.000
After Yukito's arrival,

14:36.850 --> 14:40.140
I began spending the majority of my 
days at this isolation camp village.

14:41.200 --> 14:42.400
And then...

14:43.050 --> 14:43.900
Yukito!

14:54.560 --> 14:56.280
"It" appeared.

15:04.690 --> 15:06.020
Man,

15:06.020 --> 15:11.260
life has become so pleasant 
thanks to Mitama-sama.

15:18.350 --> 15:22.060
Let's celebrate the advancement of the 
village and the growth of our faith.

15:22.060 --> 15:24.190
To Mitama-sama!

15:24.190 --> 15:26.860
Cheers!

15:26.860 --> 15:28.440
Here!

15:28.440 --> 15:29.950
Thanks for waiting!

15:38.650 --> 15:41.920
By the way, how long do I 
have to wear this outfit?

15:42.800 --> 15:43.570
Today,

15:44.240 --> 15:47.000
I gathered you here for a reason.

15:47.360 --> 15:49.980
Our Salvation through Mitama 
faith has gained followers,

15:49.980 --> 15:52.510
so it's about time we decide on a doctrine.

15:52.510 --> 15:53.970
Doctrine?

15:53.970 --> 15:55.760
What is that?

15:56.130 --> 15:57.280
To put it simply,

15:57.280 --> 15:59.440
it's things our organization aims to do,

15:59.440 --> 16:01.520
or things it has to believe.

16:04.860 --> 16:05.810
What's an example?

16:06.190 --> 16:08.280
"A ton of really tough 
stuff happened to me,

16:08.280 --> 16:09.780
but when I write it down in a notebook,

16:09.780 --> 16:11.040
I feel like I can keep going,

16:11.040 --> 16:14.610
so I'll properly train for that 
and become mentally strong",

16:14.610 --> 16:17.600
or "Don't think too hard about all sorts 
of stuff and just love each other.

16:17.600 --> 16:21.270
Then when the world goes under, 
only our followers will survive",

16:21.270 --> 16:22.780
are just two possible examples.

16:23.690 --> 16:28.130
Then how about something like this?

16:28.460 --> 16:34.590
The cloth that covers women's bodies must 
be under 10% of the body's surface area.

16:33.540 --> 16:34.590
Kill me!

16:35.190 --> 16:36.580
Since there's less laundry to do,

16:36.580 --> 16:38.330
it's two birds with one stone.

16:38.330 --> 16:42.650
Huh, that's a good idea.

16:46.720 --> 16:48.340
A doctrine, huh?

16:49.280 --> 16:52.610
So it's something our entire 
group has to believe in, right?

16:52.780 --> 16:57.710
Then, my sister is the cutest 
in the entire Empire!

16:57.710 --> 17:00.070
And, enjoy your wine!

17:00.070 --> 17:01.830
You're painting us in a bad light.

17:01.990 --> 17:03.550
What are you talking about?!

17:03.550 --> 17:06.920
The cutest is obviously Yukito.

17:05.320 --> 17:06.920
Any other suggestions?

17:06.920 --> 17:07.950
Five days of rest per week!

17:07.950 --> 17:08.780
Unlimited naps!

17:08.780 --> 17:10.910
Free refills at each meal!

17:09.520 --> 17:10.910
Yukito has to date Al!

17:10.910 --> 17:12.670
Wine is free of charge!

17:10.910 --> 17:12.670
What?! Sis?!

17:12.670 --> 17:14.880
There's no consensus here.

17:14.880 --> 17:17.290
These are all so far from being a doctrine.

17:16.220 --> 17:18.400
Why not?

17:19.840 --> 17:21.580
Stop it!

17:20.560 --> 17:24.180
The people in this village 
truly are quite free.

17:24.560 --> 17:28.970
So why not just go with 
the doctrine "live freely"?

17:35.550 --> 17:38.030
Followers, be free, huh?

17:38.350 --> 17:40.790
So you made this the doctrine in the end.

17:40.790 --> 17:41.870
Yeah.

17:41.870 --> 17:46.080
But there are no worse enemies 
than "religion" and "freedom".

17:46.960 --> 17:48.630
Then, why?

17:48.800 --> 17:51.510
Well, I figured it wasn't bad.

17:51.970 --> 17:55.580
Since I wasn't free before I 
came to this village, either.

17:57.830 --> 17:59.430
Thanks, Clen.

17:59.950 --> 18:03.530
You're the most reliable 
guy in our group here.

18:09.310 --> 18:10.940
<i>This man...</i>

18:11.440 --> 18:14.170
<i>Yukito is a really strange guy.</i>

18:14.170 --> 18:16.290
I can't believe it, when I'm right here!

18:17.010 --> 18:18.250
Mitama-chan?

18:18.250 --> 18:19.470
What's wrong?

18:19.470 --> 18:23.580
Don't go falling in love just because 
Yukito praised you a little bit!

18:23.580 --> 18:24.960
Wh-What?

18:25.540 --> 18:30.830
Geez, Yukito's always saying things that 
get girls all up in their feelings!

18:32.340 --> 18:33.460
Girls?

18:33.870 --> 18:34.970
You mean me?

18:34.970 --> 18:36.100
Yeah!

18:36.100 --> 18:38.500
Just so you know, Yukito is my follower!

18:48.940 --> 18:51.800
Can't deceive a god, huh?

18:52.730 --> 18:54.610
Yukito!

18:58.110 --> 19:00.120
I was truly shaken to the core.

19:01.150 --> 19:03.910
A real "god" can't be fooled by my ability,

19:04.120 --> 19:06.340
has similar powers to an archon,

19:06.340 --> 19:08.620
and gains power when their 
number of followers grows.

19:09.350 --> 19:10.740
I became certain that with this power,

19:10.740 --> 19:12.990
the Empire could be destroyed.

19:13.380 --> 19:14.820
Loki!

19:14.820 --> 19:16.590
So I did an experiment.

19:17.530 --> 19:18.430
An experiment?

19:18.750 --> 19:21.760
I went to a different isolation camp

19:21.760 --> 19:26.390
and showed them an illusion 
to gain a few dozen followers.

19:26.910 --> 19:29.080
What do you think happened then?

19:29.500 --> 19:31.630
I was able to use them.

19:31.630 --> 19:34.090
Powers that I am usually unable 
to use without these devices,

19:34.090 --> 19:35.500
just by myself.

19:36.150 --> 19:39.570
They built us to be like gods.

19:40.040 --> 19:40.670
So?

19:40.670 --> 19:41.660
What do you want to do?

19:42.030 --> 19:44.020
Do you want to play god or something?

19:44.730 --> 19:46.520
Not play.

19:46.520 --> 19:48.750
We'll destroy the Empire

19:48.750 --> 19:51.420
and become real "gods".

19:54.630 --> 20:00.180
We'll bring back "gods" and return 
this world to what it ought to be.

20:00.180 --> 20:01.800
Y-You're out of your mind!

20:01.800 --> 20:04.540
We exist for the Emperor and the assembly!

20:04.540 --> 20:06.540
Without them, we don't even 
have a reason to exist—

20:06.540 --> 20:09.270
Oh, I forgot to mention this.

20:09.450 --> 20:14.360
I told all archons but you that I was 
planning on destroying the palace

20:14.800 --> 20:17.870
and that we could become "gods".

20:18.730 --> 20:21.400
They all agreed.

20:21.980 --> 20:22.570
Huh?

20:22.970 --> 20:24.720
Wh-Why?

20:25.160 --> 20:29.920
It means I wasn't the only one who 
was getting sick of this world.

20:31.170 --> 20:37.130
So let's destroy this place 
and end this country, Yukito.

20:38.120 --> 20:39.000
All right.

20:39.230 --> 20:40.060
What?

20:46.170 --> 20:49.900
The "world with free will" 
that she wants isn't so bad.

20:49.900 --> 20:50.850
But...

20:51.230 --> 20:52.690
Do it, Mitama.

20:53.860 --> 20:56.600
If it's your request, I'll get right to it!

20:56.600 --> 20:58.110
D-Don't!

20:58.300 --> 21:00.400
<i>Once they are free from the Empire,</i>

21:00.400 --> 21:02.810
<i>the archons will probably 
fight among themselves.</i>

21:02.810 --> 21:03.870
<i>If that happens,</i>

21:03.870 --> 21:05.950
<i>our village will be 
dragged into it, as well.</i>

21:08.510 --> 21:10.110
<i>That's no good.</i>

21:10.110 --> 21:12.140
<i>Then nothing changes.</i>

21:12.140 --> 21:14.460
<i>There's only one way to protect them!</i>

21:14.770 --> 21:18.040
If it's your wish, I'll grant it!

21:18.230 --> 21:19.260
<i>And that's...!</i>

21:19.260 --> 21:21.080
Here I go!

21:21.800 --> 21:23.630
What was that?

21:23.970 --> 21:25.450
The palace is crumbling.

21:25.450 --> 21:27.100
Is the Emperor safe?

21:34.440 --> 21:35.860
Now, Yukito,

21:36.530 --> 21:39.580
the stage is set for the new age of gods.

21:40.240 --> 21:42.350
The world has been thrust into chaos.

21:42.350 --> 21:45.070
Now, what will you do?

21:48.450 --> 21:50.830
Nothing changes.

21:51.300 --> 21:53.460
I'm still just making this one god.

21:56.420 --> 21:59.880
You fakes can't win against a real god.

21:59.880 --> 22:01.620
Oh?

23:35.100 --> 23:40.060
Episode 6
We know we are not worthy
O great Lord Mitama

23:35.430 --> 23:37.710
We know we are not worthy

23:37.710 --> 23:40.060
O great Lord Mitama
